## Quick start
Local development with uv

```bash
uv sync --all-extras
uv run flask --app app:app run --host 0.0.0.0 --port ${PORT:-6969}
```

{% if docker %}
Pull and run the image

```bash
docker pull ghcr.io/{{ repository_name }}:latest
docker run --rm -p 6969:6969 -e PORT=6969 ghcr.io/{{ repository_name }}:latest
```
